[h2]【赛季模式】服务器将在02：35分进行维护更新，此次维护时间预计60-120分钟，给您带来不便，敬请谅解。[/h2]

[h3]维护更新内容：
1、修复新增投资项目无法购买的问题;
2、修复董卓战法释放后暴击率回退问题;
3、修复鲁肃觉醒三增加穿透不生效的问题;
4、修复菩提重复释放金刚不坏会导致福缘加成失效的问题;
5、修复十殿轮回排行客栈名显示不全的问题;
6、修复十殿轮回排行玩家信息报错无法查看的问题;
7、修复了装备祝融夫人后在关卡内无法恢复御将值的问题；
8、六道4,5玄灭尸骨增加概率掉落慕火炼丹术与慕火锻造术；
9、修复了英雄令发放时装错误的问题；(第四赛季10/26日2点35更新之前购买过英雄令的玩家，都将免费获得黑月行者称号及背挂，陆续通过邮件发放)
10、修复遗物词条升级异常的问题；[/h3]

We plan to perform a version update on the server from September 26th to 30th. This update mainly includes the installation of high-level "Six Trials" replicas, "National Day series" activities, and a series of optimizations. The specific content is as follows, and the optimization content and bug fixes will continue to increase:
All six trial series levels are fully implemented
1. The "Six Paths of Trial 4- Slow" and "Six Paths of Trial 5- Doubt" will be implemented in this version, and now the "Six Paths of Trial" series of Greed, Anger, Madness, Slow Doubt 5th difficulty levels have been fully implemented. The 'Six Paths Trial' will be the only instance in the entire game, apart from the 'Three Realms and Six Paths', to obtain the' Knight Characteristic Pill '. (Higher probability of dropping characteristic pills, sulfur and other workshop materials, as well as specific rare drops)
2. Highest difficulty [Six Paths Trial 5-Doubt] (slightly lower in difficulty than the Three Realms Six Paths)
Xuan Mie Drop Pool will be added:
-Orange Quality - Six Tailored Mounts [Six Crimson Beasts] Fragment
(After synthesis effect: Maximum Qi and Blood+25% in all six trials and the Three Realms Six Paths)
-【 Three Realms and Six Paths - Mortal Realm 】 Ticket: 【 Six Paths Reincarnation Flag 】 Fragment;
Black market merchant Hassan can collect and accumulate the required quantity to exchange for the finished product Six Crimson Beasts Madi x1 and Six Reincarnation Flag x1.
Note: The limited mount "Six Dark Red Beasts" cannot be inherited during the season, and the horse flute cannot be exchanged for horse equipment at "Xiangma Shi - Bole".
3. The 'Six Trials' series of daily tasks will be implemented, and players will receive rewards from the' Black Market Merchant - Hassan 'for completing different levels of difficulty for the first time each day.
Optimization and Implementation of Customs Clearance Overturning Rewards in the End of the Law Era
Card pool purification:
1. Removed all drops of the 'Imperial General Talisman' from the flipped card drop pool;
2. Removed all drops of 'Jianghu posts' from the flipping drop pool;
3. Removed all drops of 'Enchanted Fragrance' from the flipping drop pool.
Card Pool Optimization:
1. Add sulfur into the drop pool;
2. Add more 'Muhuo Trial Cards' to the drop pool;
3. Join the End of the Law era limited back hanging fragment of 'Shura's Claw'
(Finished effect: Basic damage+25 points in the End Law era and End Law cycle) Enter the drop pool.
Black market merchant Hassan can collect and accumulate the required quantity to exchange for the Shura Claw skin x1.
Note: In the end of the legal era, the limited back hanging of "Shura's Claw" season cannot be inherited and cannot be sold at "One Meat" to exchange for "Colorful Sky Cloth".
Sect Balance and Numerical Correction
1. Wudang Sect:
-When dealing damage in the state of the Two Instrument Sword Formation, it can restore one's own qi and blood;
-Increase the damage multiplier of the Two Instrument Sword Array;
-Increase the basic damage bonus of the Two Instrument Sword Formation;
-Slightly increase the attack range of Wudang Sect's Liangyi Sword Formation;
-The breakthrough of the Pure Yang Tai Chi technique has begun - the Thirteen Tai Chi Styles.
2. Huashan Sect:
-The root bone coefficient of 'Jade Maiden Embracing the Moon' has increased from 0.2 to 0.3;
3. Beggar's Sect:
-【 Hit the Head 】 School Breakthrough Opened - 【 No Dogs Under the Stick 】;
[Other numerical values and optimization corrections]
1. Ayi Pasha's basic price for acquiring all master craftsmen's equipment has slightly increased (+15%);
2. The workshop has added a new formula for producing relics from various eras, which requires more relic fragments but does not require the consumption of gold ingots;
3. Black market merchant Hassan's daily redemption limit for Muhuo Trial Cards and Ties has been increased.
[National Day Series Activity Implementation]
1. Daily login rewards for National Day;
2. At the end of the National Day holiday and the end of the legal era, the "National Peace and Security" seal was added to the flipping pool;
3. There is a low probability of obtaining the 'Guotai Min'an' seal when using the 'National Day Limited - Fish Bait' in the Loulan Fishing Pool;
4. [Guotai Min'an] India convertible [National Day limited edition - Loyalty Bear Headwear] (passed down from generation to generation);
5. [National Day Limited] National Essence Series Skin Returns;
6. National Day series rebate discounts and special activities.
The first round of testing for the Final Method Cycle Test Server
