[h2]【三界六道-凡人界】开启：[/h2]
[h3][*]1、开启新的挑战副本【三界六道-凡人界】副本，玩家将只身进入该副本进行试炼挑战。其中将掉落大量精炼材料及通天阁稀有道具，值得一提的是其中怪物武功深不可测，出手极重，功力不够者勿要轻易尝试;
[*]2、新增【三界六道-凡人界】系列任务【三界六道】、【不败之败】，完成后可领取【六道轮回旗】x1及【还魂玉】x3;
[*]3、限时新增【三界六道-凡人界】每日系列任务【三界之行（壹）、（贰）、（叁）】，每日可前往哈桑处提供【金锭】获得进入【三界六道-凡人界】的门票【六道轮回旗】。（持续到9月25日0点）;
[*]4、开启【三界六道-凡人界】副本单人闯关排行榜，按照各门派为榜单维度；
[*]5、新增【楼兰药酒】、【三味药酒】、【鬼方药酒】带入【三界六道-凡人界】的效果：持续回复真气效果；
[*]6、优化了六道试炼3掉落书籍的品质，现在六道3不再会出现蓝色及以下品质的书籍；
[*]7、为了避免多开小号刷丹药，我们提高了部分丹药的制作时长。[/h3]

The server is scheduled to shut down for updates starting at 18:30 on Monday, February 26, 2024. The maintenance is expected to take 60-120 minutes. The game will not be able to log in 30 minutes before and during the update period. Please play the game after the update is complete. We apologize for any inconvenience caused!



Activity updates:

[End of Activity]:

1. The activity of exchanging "Tongtian Pearl", "Tongtian Key", and "Pantao" for a 30% increase has ended;

2. The activity of "Heavenly Horse Shepherd" has ended, and "Pantao" has been taken off the shelves;

3. Closing of Spring Festival related activities and tasks;

4. Limited skin removal during the Spring Festival;

5. During the Spring Festival, Zhang Mengchen's high price recycling activity was taken down.

[Activity Start]:

1. Ayipasha's high price equipment acquisition campaign has started (some items sold to Ayipasha have increased profits);

2. The 30% increase in exchange for 【 Tongtian Pearl 】 and 【 Tongtian Key 】 is expected to last until March 31st;

3. [Muhuo Shura Robbery] The daily time has been extended from 60 minutes to 90 minutes, and the time has been adjusted to 19:30-21:00. [After the server is updated today, it will be opened 90 minutes later according to the time];

4. The first version of the daily mission of Muhuo Shura Robbery has been implemented, and you can now obtain more Asura seals through daily missions.



Fix attributes:

1. Fix the problem that some players can't put Tomatoes on sticks on the shelf;

2. Fixed the issue where some levels were unable to include dice and Pai Gow, resulting in ineffective gamers in the martial arts world;

3. Fix the issue of Black Moon 3 having a chance of getting stuck.

We will restart the server at 1:15 on February 15, 2024, and the restart is expected to take 30-60 minutes. The game will not be able to log in 30 minutes before and during the update period. Please play the game after the update is complete. We apologize for any inconvenience caused.

[Optimization Content]:

1. The Tiandi Sancai Hammer in the store has been temporarily taken down;

2. Fix the issue of items being unable to be purchased in the boutique;

3. Fixed a problem in the Six Paths where summoning fellow disciples while using regular attacks would get stuck (now unable to use regular attacks);

4. The Mu Huo Trial Card in the Six Paths Trial Gift Pack has been modified to be imitated;

5. Fix the issue of Blue Bodhi being stronger than Purple in Chivalry 9;

6. Optimized the life and damage of all BOT monsters in Xiadao 7, 8, and 9;

7. Optimized the probability of craftsmen appearing in Xiadao 7, 8, and 9.

We plan to restart the server on Monday, February 12, 2024. The updated content for this restart is as follows:



1、 Equipment inheritance issues

Considering that this is our first time with multiple equipment entries and multiple equipment inheritance for Ghost Craftsmen and Famous Craftsmen, please feel free to contact us if you encounter any problems with equipment inheritance. We will solve all inheritance issues for you as soon as possible. You can also provide feedback on your issues in the online document, and we will handle them one by one and follow up on the QQ synchronization results you have reserved;

Online document registration:

https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DWWhWUVJ6SEdXWWpK?tab=BB08J2



2、 Skill level open

The skill level is open for upgrade, with a maximum limit of ten levels. This skill opening requires the end of the resident's booth and workshop production in advance, otherwise skills cannot be upgraded at that time and can only be resolved after the new year;



3、 Optimize content

1. The three levels of Dominance 1, 2, and 3 restrict the character's skill level to be fixed at 1;

2. Production of skill book recipe for four new qualities of white, green, blue, and purple in the study;

3. The ultimate six paths include the drop rate of Shura Blood and Soul Summoning Banner;

4. Reduce the consumption of metal materials for all repair hammers.

[h2]服务器兹定于2024年1月2日(周二）18:00开始维护更新，本次更新预计60-120分钟。更新前30分钟和更新期间游戏将无法登录，请大家在更新结束之后再进行游戏，给您带来的不便敬请谅解。[/h2]

[h2]修复内容：[/h2]
[h3][*]1、修复了回馈通天匣结果显示异常的问题 ;
[*]2、修复终极六道中可能在选择BOSS以及进入下一层界面卡死的问题 ;
[*]3、修复终极六道排行奖励无法领取的问题（修复后重新打开排行点击领奖按钮进行领取）;
[*]4、增加一荤处兑换的时装道具可以出售给通天儿 ;
[*]5、一荤处增加女性教主魍魉时装出售。[/h3]

1. Fix the issue of abnormal activity count when entering activity levels before 24:00 and exiting after 24:00;

2. Fixed and recharged ranking data with incorrect data in six sections;

3. Fix the issue where the tea shop cannot continue normally after playing a game;

4. Fix the issue of abnormal damage multiplier in martial arts due to the feature of being more brave in battle and dominating;

5. Fix the issue where the villains sold by Zhang Mengchen lack destiny and qualifications;

6. Fix the issue of abnormal task count in the six levels of Dongmu;

7. Fix the issue where the rewards on the interface of the six levels of Dongmu do not match the actual rewards.



The above issues have been fixed through several restarts during the hot swapping process from December 20th to December 22nd.

After last week's trial operation, Muhuotai has been favored by a large number of PVP enthusiasts, and the participation of various owners is quite high.

In view of this, we plan to open the Mu Huo Tai for one hour every Monday, Wednesday, and Friday starting from this week, starting from 20:00 to 21:00 in the evening.

Double the time on Saturdays and Sundays, starting from 20:00 to 22:00 in the evening.



At the same time, starting from December, we will gradually implement more PVE and PVP activity gameplay, including the December arrival of Dominance 4, which will also be launched in the form of evening limited time activities. Stay tuned for a new wave of activities in the winter month.



Finally, before entering, please confirm the location of the Mu Huo Tai in all domineering maps and the necessary materials for entry to avoid unnecessary losses.

1. 【 Muhuo Wind and Sand 】 The Muhuo Terrace at the actual small market and reed marshes consumes 1 Muhuo phosphorus powder, 3 torches, and 5 cloud piercing arrows per Muhuo Terrace. After killing all the enemies that appear, go to the small Pure Land and challenge the Muhuo Terrace in the hole at the altar under the Asura statue;

2. [Mu Huo Hungry Ghost] Install the Mu Huo Terrace at the Po Abandoned Station and the Ancient Altar. Each Mu Huo Terrace consumes 5 Mu Huo Phosphorus Powder, 3 Torches, and 10 Cloud Arrows to activate. After killing all enemies that appear, go to the Po Abandoned Station and challenge the Mu Huo Terrace in the hole at the altar under the Asura statue;

3. [Muhuo Shura] Install the Muhuo Terrace at the Ghost Gate, Ghost Orientation Camp, and Black Sand Village. Each Muhuo Terrace consumes 10 Muhuo Phosphorus Powder, 3 Torches, and 20 Cloud Arrows to activate. After killing all enemies, go to the Ghost Gate and challenge the Muhuo Terrace in the hole at the altar under the Asura statue;

4. All Mu Huo Tai monsters have a certain probability of automatically dropping their equipment and loot when they die, without the need for a corpse search.

The server is scheduled to start maintenance and update on Thursday, November 21, 2023 at 18:45. This update is expected to take 60-120 minutes. The game will not be able to log in 30 minutes before and during the update period. Please continue playing the game after the update is complete. We apologize for any inconvenience caused.



Optimization adjustment:

[list]

[*] 1. The entire content of feature 1.3 is actually installed;

[*] 2. Optimization of novice task processes;

[*] 3. At the request of the city owner Batur, the booth area of Loulan Market has been expanded and divided into Qinglong District and Baihu District. If you need to set up a stall in the market, please move to Maimaiti to bid for the booth;

[*] 4. The Bahuo Sect recently transported a batch of rare treasures to the Ghost Market. Therefore, the owner Li Yan ordered Muhuo merchants to open and expand the Ghost Market trading area. If you want to take this opportunity to operate business, please go to the trading area to set up a stall for trading;

[*] 5. Remove the deduction of players being immobilized when a boss appears in the six trials;

[*] The number of clearance reward boxes for 6, 6, 1, 2, and 3 will no longer be random and will be fixed to 6;

[*] 7. Adjustment of Six Rewards (Optimization of Xuanmie's Dropping Probability, Increase in the Dropping of Two Mu Huo Trial Cards in Six Paths, Increase in the Probability of Each Difficulty Level 5 Box Appearing)

Adding broken box drop, increasing the drop rate of Blissful, Sun and Moon on Six Paths 1, 2, and 3)

[*] 8. Monster buff [Parasitic] in the six trials is temporarily removed from the random pool;

[*] 9. New items in the Tongtian Pavilion series: [Heavenly Forging Hammer/Earth Covering Forging Hammer/Qingren Forging Hammer] You can choose to randomly convert a certain [Heaven/Earth/Person] level affix on the [Famous Craftsman] equipment into any corresponding level of [Heaven/Earth/Person] level affix

(Used in the recast interface, the Heavenly Hammer consumes 1 recast count, while the Earthcover and Heavenly Man do not consume any recast count), which can be exchanged at Tongtian'er;

[*] 10. New props: [Muhuo Phosphate Powder] purchased from Li Yan using 1 gold ingot, for the new gameplay of [Muhuo Platform] that will be put into trial operation in the next version;

[*] 11. The actual installation of the prop [Bodhi Bodhisattva] icon;

[*] 12. Newly added fashion hairstyle special effects, male hairstyle: Dailunmingwang Kumarata (special effect on the head position of the hairstyle).

[/list]



Defect repair:

[list]

[*] 1. Fixed the issue where the Thunderbolt Fire Life feature at full level would produce incorrect effects;

[*] 2. Fixed the issue of hunting techniques and Dragon Diving Skill features not being able to obtain experience normally;

[*] 3. Fixed the issue of Ghost Market stall names appearing in the Loulan Market;

[*] 4. Fixed the issue of Xuanmie not being able to use skills due to insufficient internal power in the six trials;

[*] 5. Fixed the issue of not being able to see the lowest market price when modifying the prices of goods that have already been listed on the exchange consignment and then going offline and online.

[/list]

We plan to upgrade the client version and update the weekly version of 'Season Mode' within this week (November 22-24).

Due to the large amount of content in this update, there may be many defects (bugs). Please feel free to provide timely feedback to the group management [David] when any defects are found.



The updated content plan for this week is as follows:

1、 The feature 1.3 version is fully installed, and all forward-looking features have been installed. Please feel free to provide feedback if you encounter any feature issues;

2、 The first phase of the expansion of Loulan Market and Ghost Market has been completed. The hidden signs of Loulan Market are now divided into two stall areas, namely the left Qinglong District and the right Baihu District;

[img] {STEAP_CLAN_IMAGE}/42251881/c0b8a56e3deda1b09b2b1b11b4dd2dc8eec98e35.jpg [/img]

[img] {STEAP_CLAN_IMAGE}/42251881/eb348b0126d042876c8bc393760d67a55a106b4.jpg [/img]

3、 The Overlord Mu Huo Tai 1.0 gameplay is fully equipped, and the Bot monsters summoned by Mu Huo Tai are extremely skilled, with extraordinary martial arts skills. They wear "Mu Huo Trial Cards" on their waists and ghost crafting weapons, which are actually formidable characters in the domineering world. If they are not experts, don't easily call them to death;

4、 The 'Mu Huo Trial Card' in the Six Paths 2 has appeared more frequently than before;

5、 The probability of Six Paths 1, 2, and 3 Dark Destruction and various levels of Dark Gold Boxes has been slightly increased;

6、 Tongtian Pavilion: The Heavenly Forging Hammer, Earth Covering Forging Hammer, and Qingren Forging Hammer are mounted and can be recast for different levels of 'Heavenly, Earthly, and Human'; Example: Using the 'Heavenly Forging Hammer' can randomly transform the 'Tian' affix on the target equipment into another 'Tian' affix;

7、 Novice guided task optimization version 2.

[Season Mode] Ver.1115 Update Announcement

The server is scheduled to shut down for updates starting at 18:00 on Wednesday, November 15, 2023. This update is expected to take 30-90 minutes. The game will not be able to log in 30 minutes before and during the update period. Please continue playing the game after the update is complete. We apologize for any inconvenience caused.



Optimization adjustment:

1. Adjust the Qi damage effect of weapon entries to significantly reduce the amount of true Qi consumed on hits (5-->1);

2. Optimize the difficulty of Black Moon mode in level 6 of Chivalry, reduce the number of Ghost Guard Assassins on the boss plot to 2, and reduce the number of Ghost Guard Assassins on the Huangyangpo plot to 1;

3. Zuo Yulong's cloak (male) and Zuo Yulong's cloak (female) will be available for trading on exchanges and stalls;

4. New records of character biographies and usage times of characteristic pills;

5. Optimization of feature generation linkage probability, with some multi entry probabilities slightly reduced;

6. The merchant's skill has been increased to level 15. Add 2 more product locations at level 11, 2 more product locations at level 12, 3 more product locations at level 13, 3 more product locations at level 14, and 5 more product locations at level 15.



Defect repair:

1. Fixed the issue of incorrect description of weapon entry crazy demon text;

2. Fixed the issue of not dropping other rewards when Tuoba Tiger and Wang Wu dropped their spirit in domineering levels;

3. Fixed the issue of closing the interface when a cloud mask appeared during GIF rotation on the mall interface, resulting in the mask not disappearing;

4. Fixed the issue of not being able to see the lowest market price for a consignment item on the Ghost Market Exchange after obtaining an item that was not in the warehouse;

5. Fixed the issue of some feature interfaces displaying incorrectly;

6. Fixed issue with refresh button on reward task images;

7. Fixed the issue of losing escape points at level 456 of Chivalry;

8. Fixed a problem where some pills could be used against the protagonist [Xiao Liu];

9. Fixed an issue where Fuyuan cannot recover when characters carrying the Tiansha Lonely Star feature are removed. (The problematic character can be repaired by moving the wing or getting on or off the shelf through another Tiansha Lone Star character);

10. Fixed the issue of locked equipment being acquired and sold by caravans.

Novice Protection:

1. Add beginner domineering 1. Entering domineering 1 during the Gold Quest series will only match players who have also taken on the series of missions;

2. Increase the limit on matching reputation levels for level 1 of Dominance, and players at levels 1-10, 11-20, and above will automatically be matched to players within the same level range.



Optimization content:

1. After switching to the next level in the six trials, clear the bleeding state of bot teammates;

2. The effect of the use of the Heaven Supplementing Talisman in the Six Paths Trial will be effective for the entire team;

3. New Tongtian Pavilion series props:

[Sect Sect Order]: It can enhance the status of Xiake within the sect (the quality of Xiake has been improved from blue to purple)

【 Assistant Director's Life Letter 】: It can enhance the status of Xiake in the sect (the quality of Xiake has been improved from purple to orange);

4. The actual six ways of Xuanmie drop, and now Xuanmie in six ways 1, 2, and 3 begins to drop Xuanmie Spirit, Blood Jade, Heaven, Earth and People Pills, as well as other elixirs and secret letters from various factions;

5. Expand the interaction range of the six stone tablets;

6. Within Xiadao 456, there are new escape points added to the plot where the boss is located.



Defect repair:

1. Fix the issue of missing interactive icons between the six turntables and the stone tablets;

2. Fixed some issues where characteristic pills can still be used when the slot is full in some cases;

3. Fix the issue of wooden saws being unable to obtain and pick up in level 123 of Overlord;

4. Fixed the issue of missing identification colors;

5. Fixed some cases where equipment precision repair functionality was abnormal;

6. Fixed the issue of displaying horse riding animations in the recruitment section of storytellers due to the incorrect image of Xiake;

7. Fixed the issue of errors in the fashion interface in some cases;

8. Fixed the issue of compensation email reputation level 15+24 hours online and still unable to display.

1、 Tongtian Pavilion Real Decoration:

Newly added Tongtiange series props, available for purchase at Tongtian'er using Tongtianzhu:

1. 【 Easy to change box 】: Randomly change the skin color of Xiake;

2. 【 Overturning Sky/Overcoming Earth/Lifting Man Forging Hammer 】: Randomly transform a certain level affix of 【 Heaven/Earth/Man 】 on the equipment of 【 Famous Craftsman 】 into any corresponding level affix;

3. 【 Ghost Craftsman/Famous Craftsman Forging Hammer 】: After use, randomly increase the equipment's forging frequency by 0 to 3 times;

4. Warehouse Expansion Order: After use, the warehouse space will be increased by 20 spaces. Up to 30 cards can be used, and cannot be inherited at the end of the season;

5. 【 Tiangong Kaiwu Pill/Di Shefu Tu Pill/Ren Qi Kunlun Powder 】: You can choose to randomly transform a certain 【 Tian/Di/Ren 】 characteristic of a Xiake into any corresponding level characteristic. (Qualifications and destiny cannot be changed, and the total number of times a single Xiake can use the three life changing pills is up to 3 times);

6. 【 Forget Soul Flower 】: You can choose to permanently erase a certain feature of the Xiake. Note: If the last feature is not erased, after erasing it, all features will gradually progress. (Please make sure to confirm before use to avoid damaging the Xiake's Eight Extraordinary Meridians);

7. 【 Beyond the Frontier 】: 【 Outside the Frontier Swordsman 】 Opening Box, 【 Outside the Frontier Swordsman 】 Opening Box, 【 Outside the Frontier Escort 】 Opening Box. After opening, you can obtain corresponding exclusive opening equipment, opening exclusive title, Refined Steel Greedy Wolf Box x1, Refined Steel Wuqu Box x1, Refined Steel Breaking Army Box x1, Palo Storage Bag x1, and Seven Sect Secret Letter x3.



2、 Fashion adjustment:

1. Time limited fashion exchange for Tongtian'er: 【 Back Hanging Nine tailed Spirit Fox 】, 【 Heavy Sword Burning Sky 】, 【 Big Knife Sawing Flame 】, 【 Long Stick Swallowing Flint 】, lasting until late November.;

2. Fashion: 【 Back Hanging Nine Tailed Spirit Fox 】, 【 Imitation · Back Hanging Nine Tailed Spirit Fox 】, 【 Headwear Da Lun Ming Wang 】, 【 Imitation · Headwear Da Lun Ming Wang 】, 【 Master Invincible (Male) 】, 【 Master Invincible (Female) 】, 【 Imitation · Master Invincible (Female) 】, 【 Fashion Sword Burning Sky 】, 【 Blade Saw Flame 】, 【 Long Stick Swallowing Flint 】 Quality adjusted to red

3. Fashion: [Headwear - Great Wheel Ming King - Kumaratian], [Headwear - Sect Leader Invincible - Demon Head (male)], [Headwear - Sect Leader Invincible - Demon Head (female)], [Dark Star Series Weapons], [Glass Series Weapons], [Purple Cloud Series Weapons] Limited time addition to the Tongtian Box and Feedback - Tongtian Box Treasure Pool, lasting until late November.



3、 Equipment adjustment:

1. Adjust the equipment entry crazy magic effect (each kill a bot's own basic damage+3/6/10, lasting for 15/20/30 seconds, with a maximum stack of 10/15/20 layers);

2. Adjust the equipment entry to devour the main effect (absorbs 1% of the main's HP every 5 seconds, increases critical hit rate by 3%/5%/8%, increases critical damage by 15%/30%/50%, and increases weapon damage by an additional 5/10/20 points);

3. Blacksmiths have a 5% chance of crafting weapons and equipment to create Ghost Craftsman items;

4. Increase the probability of blacksmiths producing weapons and equipment to produce famous craftsmen;

5. Add a secondary confirmation interface for Ghost Craftsman equipment inlay;

6. 【 Recasting 】 Function Reset: Right click on the equipment to open the operation list and select 【 Recasting 】. The 【 Equipment Recasting 】 interface will be called up. You can directly view the detailed properties of the equipment on this interface and select various recast items you already have to recast multiple times.



4、 New player identity system: [Mu Huo Zhong], [Murder Sword], [Xiangyanghua]:

[Mu Huo Zhong]: All new owners who have just entered the Jianghu will default to [Mu Huo Zhong]. Players with [Mu Huo Zhong] status will not generate [Waist Token] after being defeated in a domineering manner Entering all domineering maps will have "Fire Seeker's Protection" (defeated for the first time in this exploration, will be randomly teleported to an initial safe land when they enter the battle, providing movement speed+100 points, full physical resistance+10%, restoring 2% of current HP every 3 seconds, and lasting for 1 minute of protection. In a battle, the "Fire Seeker's Protection" effect can only take effect once at most.)



